      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0220_fairybb_04",
      "hash64": "90B02F86A38DA37D",
      "text": "But with the way things are now, I’m sorry to say\\nthat it does, well...complicate matters.\\c\\nWe’re having a bit of a hard time knowing how\\nwe ought to proceed...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
